------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers the source code and build scripts written by the AMDLSS5
authors (the host nr_host, its loader, the helper, the installer and the
shaders and kernels in this repository that carry no other notice).

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights to, the following. Each keeps its own
license or terms, listed in instalador/modelos/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt:

  * NVIDIA DLSS / Neural Rendering files (nvngx_dlssnr.dll and the network
    weights read from it). They are NVIDIA's property and are used unchanged.
  * The SCRFD detection model weights (nr_scrfd.bin, InsightFace project):
    research / non-commercial use only.
  * AMD ROCm/HIP runtime DLLs and AMD FidelityFX binaries and SDK files.
  * Other third-party components with their own notices (for example RenoDX,
    RedDukeDev kernels, OpenDLSS-NR, REFramework SDK, XeSS SDK headers, Khronos
    PBR Neutral, ACES 2.0, Bend Screen Space Shadows).

Research material under analysis/, docs/ and other archive folders that records
measurements of third-party products is kept as history and is not part of the
shipped 2.0 code; see docs/LICENCA-AUDITORIA-2.0.md.
